(
K04 condif7 (2026-10-06): the _node restriction of the edge families
selects SIDES whose nodes are ALL in the list (Professional 02-08-2026).
10 x 10 quad4, conductivity 1, temp 0 on the right edge (nodes 2 4),
heat flux 1 on the edges selected by condif_heat_edge_normal_node 1 3 4:
the left side (1-3) and the top side (3-4). The bottom side (1-2) has
only node 1 in the list and gets no flux.
Professional 02-08-2026: temp(1) = 12, temp(3) = 18.
GNU before K04 (node by node): 20 / 20 (the bottom side also got flux
on node 1, the corner nodes doubled). Pro test condif7 (nodes 1 3):
analytic T = 10 - x, temp(1) = temp(3) = 10 (GNU before: 20).
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
condif_temperature
end_initia
start_define
  world geometry_point 1
end_define
world 0. 0. 1.e10
node 1  0 0
node 2  10 0
node 3  0  10
node 4  10 10
element 1  -quad4 1 2 3 4
group_type 0  -condif
group_condif_conductivity 0 1
geometry_line 1  10.0  0.0 10.0  10.0  0.01
bounda_dof 0  -geometry_line 1 -temp
bounda_time    0  0. 0. 100. 0.
condif_heat_edge_normal      0  1.0
condif_heat_edge_normal_geometry 0  -world
condif_heat_edge_normal_node 0 1 3 4
control_timestep 10  1. 1.
target_item    1  -node_dof 1 -temp
target_value   1  12.0 1.e-8
target_item    2  -node_dof 3 -temp
target_value   2  18.0 1.e-8
end_data
